TreeForge Bootstrap Framebuffer licensing
=========================================

TreeForge-owned userspace, host tooling, tests, documentation, and
provider metadata in this repository are licensed under Apache-2.0.

Linux kernel patch material under kernel/ is licensed under
GPL-2.0-only.

The corresponding license texts are provided in:

    LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt
    LICENSES/GPL-2.0-only.txt

Individual source files may carry SPDX identifiers where appropriate.
